OL,3,GNEWSATriple killer had 'delusions'
OL,4,Abefore attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Sgt Martin Sutcliffe said
OL,7,FLewis-Ranwell later said he was having
OL,8,Fdelusions about "people being either
OL,9,Ftrapped, kidnapped or held against
OL,10,Ftheir will" and was feeling a
OL,11,Fcompulsion to help.
